<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - July 10.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - July 10.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST  180 CST    MDO    GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   95/98     99/101    UNQ    145/152</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  99/103   102/105  160/163  169/172</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Singapore bunker levels hovered around Wednesday's levels amid buying interest in the cargo market, traders said on Thursday. However, suppliers said they did not plan to raise offers further as shipowners started to step to the sidelines following firmer bunker levels.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3571)</p>
